      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, i'm looking at some long term energy plays for a client. given how much governments are pushing for net zero, is the shift to renewables basically a done deal at this point, or is it still a massive economic risk to bet everything on it? turn it into a quick risk assessment for me. thanks.mount the inevitability",
